@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### Metadata
GET {{base}}/meta

### Paginated search (repeat town/type/tier to select multiple)
GET {{base}}/parks?town=板橋區&town=新店區&size=10&sort=risk

### Top risk records
GET {{base}}/risk/top?k=10

### Park detail — replace with an id returned by /parks for other datasets
GET {{base}}/parks/d3529bca-98d5-4761-9ff3-40ee3716d1dc

### Offline or template brief
GET {{base}}/parks/d3529bca-98d5-4761-9ff3-40ee3716d1dc/brief

### Districts
GET {{base}}/districts

### Map filtered by town and tier
GET {{base}}/map?town=板橋區&tier=高

### Backtest curve
GET {{base}}/curve

### Current week's dispatch sheet
GET {{base}}/worklist?k=50

### Invalid parameter: 400
GET {{base}}/risk/top?k=abc

### Missing park: 404
GET {{base}}/parks/missing
